# Accepted findings for terraform/. Every line needs a reason a reviewer can challenge.

# AVD-AWS-0107: security group allows ingress from 0.0.0.0/0.
# Intentional: UDP 51820 is the WireGuard entry point, the ONLY thing exposed to the internet.
AVD-AWS-0107

# AVD-AWS-0104: security group allows egress to 0.0.0.0/0.
# vpn-gw must reach the internet (it is the NAT for the private subnet); gitlab egress is limited to ports 80/443.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AVD-AWS-0009: instance gets a public IP at launch.
# Intentional: vpn-gw is the public entry point. gitlab has none (associate_public_ip_address = false).
AVD-AWS-0009

# AVD-AWS-0132: S3 bucket not encrypted with a customer-managed KMS key.
# Backups use SSE-S3 (AES-256) and the config archive is additionally encrypted client-side. Lab scope.
AVD-AWS-0132
